# The read-path build every five minutes (decision 061): it fetches Maplify, iNaturalist
# and Orcasound itself, so its cadence is the ingest's, as pg_cron's was (salish-xv35.5).
# The change listener still builds a few seconds after a native sighting is saved; a
# build that finds another holding the lock skips. At one past and every five minutes
# after, because Pacific midnight falls on the hour in both PST and PDT, and until a
# build runs after it, "today" is a day no build has reached. supercronic runs this in
# UTC, which for a five-minute job is the same.
1-59/5 * * * * /app/fly/build.sh
